WEBVTT

00:37.787 --> 00:41.958
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

01:11.821 --> 01:12.947
Mrs. Nawol.

01:14.532 --> 01:16.117
- Mrs. Nawol.
- What is it?

01:17.577 --> 01:18.787
Who sent this letter?

01:19.370 --> 01:20.497
There's no name on it.

01:20.997 --> 01:22.624
Mm. I have no idea.

01:23.416 --> 01:25.919
- It wasn't you who left it on the desk?
- It wasn't.

01:27.462 --> 01:30.215
Hey, Beom-o, did you put it on his desk?

01:30.298 --> 01:31.800
No, it wasn't me either.

01:32.717 --> 01:35.386
Why? What's wrong?
What does the letter say?

01:37.514 --> 01:38.389
What?

01:38.473 --> 01:40.391
Was it something bad, Master Jang?

01:43.311 --> 01:45.730
I'LL BE WAITING AT THE MOONLIGHT BAR.

01:49.776 --> 01:51.361
Get your hens here!

01:51.444 --> 01:53.238
They're quiet, nice, and docile!

01:53.738 --> 01:56.032
Here! Take a look at the chickens!

01:56.116 --> 01:58.952
Look at the hens! Get your chickens here!

02:02.914 --> 02:05.208
It'd be best
if you didn't go in, Master Jang.

02:06.167 --> 02:07.085
It's her.

02:37.740 --> 02:38.825
There you are.

02:41.077 --> 02:42.662
It's been, what, two years

02:43.538 --> 02:44.706
since the war ended?

02:44.789 --> 02:46.958
I thought you had gone back to Japan.

02:47.709 --> 02:49.586
So you didn't think I was dead, then?

02:55.049 --> 02:58.344
I would like to know why you summoned me.
What do you want?

03:01.723 --> 03:03.808
I deserve an apology from you

03:04.309 --> 03:06.769
for having ruined my husband's funeral…

03:09.272 --> 03:10.857
and for how I was hurt.

03:14.569 --> 03:18.239
So many Koreans died in Ongseong Hospital.
We have been mourning them.

03:19.073 --> 03:23.745
So is that how you justify
carrying out the terrorist attack on me?

03:25.997 --> 03:27.916
I think resistance is a better word.

03:29.918 --> 03:32.086
I was a good friend to you, Master Jang.

03:35.632 --> 03:39.302
And I thought you considered me a friend.
That's why I helped you.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.596
I did so much for you.

03:42.222 --> 03:44.432
And instead of remaining loyal,

03:44.515 --> 03:46.726
you disrespected me
with contemptuous acts.

03:50.396 --> 03:52.148
When you're part of a real friendship,

03:52.649 --> 03:55.360
you don't keep a record
of how much the other owes you.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.947
It's about sharing
and understanding each other.

04:05.411 --> 04:07.914
It's time for you
to leave the country, Lady Maeda.

04:08.706 --> 04:11.459
The era of your terror has come to an end.

04:14.128 --> 04:15.296
It is my hope

04:16.089 --> 04:17.382
that we never meet again.

04:49.455 --> 04:51.916
The House of Golden Treasure is no more.

04:53.376 --> 04:56.629
You will have nothing… left in this world.

05:04.137 --> 05:05.388
Beom-o, hurry!

06:13.289 --> 06:14.123
Mr. Gu!

06:59.961 --> 07:00.878
Mrs. Nawol…

07:01.379 --> 07:02.505
Ah!

07:30.575 --> 07:31.993
Get the hell outta here,

07:32.076 --> 07:33.661
you fucking assholes.

08:15.244 --> 08:18.498
I gave some thought
to what you said to me earlier today.

08:19.999 --> 08:21.959
And I must say, I don't agree with you.

08:23.544 --> 08:27.632
I believe friendship is about
blind loyalty until the end

08:27.715 --> 08:29.300
while also exchanging favors.

09:19.267 --> 09:20.226
Mrs. Nawol.

09:21.852 --> 09:22.687
Mrs. Nawol.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.317
Mrs. Nawol.

09:29.277 --> 09:30.319
Mrs. Nawol.

09:34.740 --> 09:37.326
Mrs. Nawol. Mrs. Nawol, wake up.

09:38.327 --> 09:39.787
Mrs. Nawol.

09:40.371 --> 09:41.497
Look at me.

09:44.667 --> 09:46.002
Water. Water.

09:47.545 --> 09:48.754
I need to get water.

10:16.616 --> 10:17.658
Ah, no!

10:17.742 --> 10:19.619
No! No, Mr. Gu.

10:19.702 --> 10:20.703
Beom-o!

10:22.747 --> 10:24.373
Mr. Gu! No!

10:30.630 --> 10:31.964
Mr. Gu!

10:32.632 --> 10:33.674
Mr. Gu!

10:35.885 --> 10:36.886
No!

10:36.969 --> 10:38.638
No, don't go! Why?

10:38.721 --> 10:40.431
Oh no!

10:43.851 --> 10:45.061
Why?

10:45.770 --> 10:47.772
Those damn sons of bitches!

10:48.856 --> 10:49.899
Damn it!

11:34.026 --> 11:35.027
Master Jang.

11:45.371 --> 11:46.414
Master Jang.

11:49.875 --> 11:51.210
Can you hear me?

11:53.546 --> 11:55.047
Are you all right, Mrs. Nawol?

11:57.049 --> 11:59.260
Are you hurt, Master Jang?

11:59.343 --> 12:01.846
I feel… strange.

12:07.643 --> 12:08.894
And I feel really cold.

12:11.772 --> 12:13.107
And my head hurts bad.

12:17.611 --> 12:19.113
Can you help me, Mrs. Nawol?

12:25.703 --> 12:26.746
Mrs. Nawol.

12:30.583 --> 12:31.625
I'm coming.

13:07.745 --> 13:08.621
Mrs. Nawol.

13:11.123 --> 13:12.041
Tae-sang.

13:23.427 --> 13:24.428
You need to run.

13:27.932 --> 13:29.099
Go now.

13:33.521 --> 13:34.480
Get away.

13:40.486 --> 13:42.029
I'll be all right, Tae-sang.

13:54.667 --> 13:55.793
I understand.

14:00.005 --> 14:01.090
I'll be okay.

14:04.885 --> 14:05.803
You have…

14:09.473 --> 14:11.100
my permission, Tae-sang.

14:32.288 --> 14:36.208
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN CURSE AND BLESSING

14:36.292 --> 14:40.254
EPISODE 5
THE CREATURE

14:53.642 --> 14:55.311
People mistakenly believe

14:56.645 --> 14:59.106
that they will achieve ultimate happiness

14:59.857 --> 15:01.817
once they have everything they desire.

15:03.861 --> 15:05.029
However,

15:05.613 --> 15:07.489
once you have acquired everything,

15:08.365 --> 15:09.909
you're overcome with boredom.

15:13.078 --> 15:14.747
And from that boredom,

15:14.830 --> 15:18.083
slowly but surely, you become apathetic.

15:24.965 --> 15:26.383
And your new desire

15:27.426 --> 15:28.802
is to destroy.

15:35.142 --> 15:38.187
Every time I witness
the fear of an individual,

15:39.146 --> 15:40.648
it makes me feel alive.

15:42.316 --> 15:43.484
I am reminded

15:44.610 --> 15:45.778
of my power.

15:48.781 --> 15:50.282
It has been a long time,

15:52.034 --> 15:53.494
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

15:56.872 --> 15:58.248
How are you still…

16:00.334 --> 16:02.711
I presume it is the same reason

16:03.462 --> 16:04.797
that you're still alive.

16:15.099 --> 16:16.183
Amazing.

16:19.687 --> 16:21.021
Was it your mother's?

16:26.944 --> 16:28.737
It feels like so long ago…

16:30.990 --> 16:32.866
though seeing you face to face,

16:33.409 --> 16:36.286
I am remembering it all
so clearly a second time.

16:37.496 --> 16:39.164
Like it all happened yesterday.

16:42.292 --> 16:44.837
Your mother and you…

16:47.047 --> 16:48.382
and Master Jang.

16:50.759 --> 16:52.553
Why are you still even here?

16:55.472 --> 16:57.474
Why stick around after all these years?

16:59.727 --> 17:01.061
Well, why not?

17:01.145 --> 17:02.938
We're no longer adversaries.

17:04.648 --> 17:06.900
What we did is now a forgotten past.

17:07.568 --> 17:08.569
Why not be here?

17:13.824 --> 17:15.743
We gave the Najin to your mother.

17:16.869 --> 17:18.495
You have it because of us.

17:19.121 --> 17:20.789
Can't you be a little grateful?

17:23.667 --> 17:28.630
So always remember
that you're still… breathing thanks to us.

17:30.424 --> 17:31.842
As well as Master Jang.

17:41.810 --> 17:43.854
You experimented on him too?

17:47.524 --> 17:49.276
That was a favor I did for him.

17:51.445 --> 17:52.321
As a friend.

17:52.404 --> 17:53.489
You…

17:59.119 --> 18:00.370
How could you?

18:01.747 --> 18:03.290
How could you do that?

18:04.458 --> 18:06.668
How could you do this to us?

18:07.252 --> 18:09.797
He doesn't deserve this! How could you?

18:12.758 --> 18:13.675
Do you know…

18:15.928 --> 18:19.681
what it is that makes hell so… cruel?

18:25.354 --> 18:27.022
The suffering never ends.

18:29.775 --> 18:31.443
If he and I can't be friends,

18:33.153 --> 18:34.738
then my wish is to

18:35.906 --> 18:37.074
become his hell.

19:02.683 --> 19:05.727
Why are you suddenly
involving her in the experiment?

19:09.231 --> 19:10.440
Why? What's the concern.

19:10.524 --> 19:12.276
Introducing outlying variables

19:12.359 --> 19:14.486
can ruin the progress
we have already made.

19:15.404 --> 19:18.574
It increases the possibilities
for an unpredictable situation.

19:22.077 --> 19:23.787
We're not experimenting on her.

19:25.998 --> 19:28.834
This is 79 years in the making between us.

19:30.836 --> 19:33.672
I am… getting revenge.

20:04.244 --> 20:05.871
Master Jang.

20:19.593 --> 20:20.761
Master Jang!

20:21.261 --> 20:23.305
Can you see me, Master Jang!

20:27.935 --> 20:30.771
Are you still all right?
Just stay right there!

20:38.987 --> 20:40.113
It's time to choose.

20:41.073 --> 20:43.200
Will you return to who you were before?

20:44.034 --> 20:44.910
Or will you…

20:47.287 --> 20:48.455
…die here as you are?

20:54.670 --> 20:55.754
What will it be?

20:56.755 --> 20:59.508
You need to decide. Tell me.

21:01.843 --> 21:03.762
Do you want to die in front of her?

21:08.892 --> 21:10.185
If I go back…

21:14.815 --> 21:16.024
to how I was…

21:20.529 --> 21:21.822
…can I beat you?

21:24.116 --> 21:24.950
Possibly.

21:26.910 --> 21:28.996
And… can I…

21:31.665 --> 21:32.916
…save her too?

21:39.423 --> 21:40.257
Possibly.

21:46.305 --> 21:48.807
I'm coming for you,
Master Jang. Stay there.

21:48.890 --> 21:50.851
Just don't die on me, all right?

21:51.977 --> 21:54.313
I'll find a way to get to you! Don't die!

21:54.396 --> 21:56.148
I won't leave you here alone!

21:56.231 --> 21:58.483
I will find a way out for us!

21:58.567 --> 22:00.152
I'll be there soon!

22:40.317 --> 22:41.651
Don't do this.

22:45.113 --> 22:47.574
Don't do it! No! No!

22:48.575 --> 22:52.245
No! Stop! Stop!

22:52.329 --> 22:54.498
No! Stop!

22:55.874 --> 22:57.209
Let me out!

23:05.550 --> 23:07.886
Don't do it. Master Jang!

23:11.098 --> 23:13.558
No! Don't do it!

23:13.642 --> 23:15.310
Don't do it!

23:40.293 --> 23:42.462
No, Master Jang!

24:51.907 --> 24:53.533
I'm looking for someone.

24:56.828 --> 24:58.038
Until the cherry blossoms…

24:58.121 --> 25:00.624
Until the cherry blossoms
lose their flowers.

25:01.875 --> 25:04.085
That's my mother.

25:09.925 --> 25:12.677
- Make a promise to each other.
- Stay alive.

25:12.761 --> 25:15.347
Do you think those good times
will come to us as well?

25:15.430 --> 25:17.599
No! Why?! Why?!

25:20.435 --> 25:22.896
Master Jang, look, the cherry…

25:24.898 --> 25:27.234
blossoms have lost their flowers.

25:30.403 --> 25:31.738
Master Jang!

25:33.240 --> 25:34.407
Master Jang!

25:40.121 --> 25:41.498
Let me out of here.

25:42.082 --> 25:43.375
It's already too late.

25:44.751 --> 25:46.753
There's nothing
you can do for him anymore.

25:57.430 --> 25:58.640
Get her!

27:14.382 --> 27:15.592
Yoon Chae-ok.

27:19.429 --> 27:20.472
Where is she?

28:26.621 --> 28:28.248
Ho-jae has the Najin again.

28:34.546 --> 28:36.923
It seems
the situation we feared has occurred.

28:40.927 --> 28:43.763
Jang Tae-sang has the Najin again.
He's looking for the woman.

28:47.892 --> 28:48.852
Bring him here.

28:51.187 --> 28:52.439
I need to speak with him.

28:55.692 --> 28:56.943
And what about the woman?

29:04.033 --> 29:05.160
Execute her.

29:07.454 --> 29:08.455
Yes, Lady Maeda.

29:32.645 --> 29:34.814
Just my luck. Seriously.

29:57.337 --> 29:59.255
Who are you?

30:00.673 --> 30:02.008
I should ask you that.

30:02.675 --> 30:04.093
I asked first, so you go.

30:04.177 --> 30:08.139
Well, I am… friends with
the company presidents that live here.

30:08.223 --> 30:11.267
I sometimes bring over
kimchi and side dishes for them.

30:11.351 --> 30:14.270
Now it's your turn. Are you acquainted?

30:15.814 --> 30:18.900
No, I don't really know them very well.
At least not like you.

30:21.361 --> 30:23.029
Then why'd you make a hole in the wall?

30:23.905 --> 30:25.865
Oh, that wasn't me. I didn't do that.

30:26.574 --> 30:29.118
I'm calling the police.
What numbers do I dial again?

30:29.202 --> 30:30.787
Oh, there's no need, miss.

30:30.870 --> 30:35.083
Detective Noh Ji-su, Jongno Police
Violent Crimes Unit, at your service.

30:35.166 --> 30:37.001
I am currently pursuing a suspect.

30:37.085 --> 30:38.336
Interesting.

30:38.878 --> 30:40.088
And who's the suspect here?

30:40.171 --> 30:42.257
Uh, Jang Ho-jae is.

30:44.592 --> 30:46.594
You know what I never could figure out?

30:47.178 --> 30:49.681
Why do you guys
always go after innocent people

30:49.764 --> 30:51.808
and let the real criminals go scot-free?

30:51.891 --> 30:53.226
Now listen here, miss.

30:53.309 --> 30:54.185
That's enough.

30:54.811 --> 30:55.645
Go ahead, call.

30:55.728 --> 30:56.646
What?

30:56.729 --> 30:58.648
Your captain. Call him.
Get him on the phone.

30:58.731 --> 31:01.484
My captain? Why would I… do that?

31:01.568 --> 31:02.902
Should I call, then?

31:11.786 --> 31:12.954
Mm. Detective Noh.

31:13.037 --> 31:16.374
Hey. Myung-jun, listen.
I'm the lady from Sinseol-dong.

31:17.458 --> 31:19.419
Ah, yes, ma'am. Is everything all right?

31:19.502 --> 31:21.421
This is concerning Master Jang.

31:22.005 --> 31:24.591
Where are you now?
Shall I go to you, or you coming here?

31:29.888 --> 31:30.972
Where do we meet?

31:32.724 --> 31:34.058
So you've lost the woman?

31:34.142 --> 31:35.435
I'm sorry, sir.

31:35.518 --> 31:38.605
When you attack with nitrogen,
they'll begin to build immunity.

31:38.688 --> 31:41.399
Like when someone gets
the common cold and builds tolerance.

31:42.483 --> 31:45.904
And we all know when Ho-jae flips out,
he can't be handled.

31:47.614 --> 31:51.075
The only one who could stop him…
is probably the boss.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.077
What if we

31:54.162 --> 31:55.538
release the kid downstairs?

31:56.748 --> 31:58.333
Number 71, was it?

31:58.416 --> 32:00.084
He might take down Ho-jae.

32:05.256 --> 32:07.425
- Release the Kurokos.
- Yes, sir.

32:48.883 --> 32:49.884
Where is she?

32:51.469 --> 32:52.679
Where is she? Tell me now.

32:54.472 --> 32:56.140
Where is she?

33:51.320 --> 33:53.239
I don't know what came over me,

33:53.740 --> 33:55.533
but everything faded away.

33:57.243 --> 34:00.371
What I was fighting for,
my original purpose,

34:00.872 --> 34:02.373
and even the rage I once felt.

34:09.839 --> 34:12.800
None of that could overcome
a certain yearning inside of me.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.531
I was existing,

34:37.200 --> 34:38.534
but I was not living.

34:44.665 --> 34:47.585
I just… wanted
to see her again.

35:02.517 --> 35:04.227
I wanted to embrace her.

35:05.853 --> 35:06.729
I wanted

35:07.814 --> 35:09.190
to hold her in my arms.

35:19.784 --> 35:20.618
Master Jang!

35:20.701 --> 35:22.453
Even if it was just
one more time.

35:23.746 --> 35:25.289
If it meant I could see you.

36:03.619 --> 36:04.495
If it meant

36:05.872 --> 36:07.206
I could touch you again.

36:23.181 --> 36:24.599
Master Jang.

36:36.944 --> 36:38.112
It's you.

36:44.076 --> 36:45.494
I'm here with you.

37:55.064 --> 37:56.023
What's going on?

37:56.107 --> 37:57.858
Two Kuroko groups were annihilated.

38:14.500 --> 38:15.710
What happened here?

38:16.210 --> 38:19.714
As you can see, no one stood a chance.

38:20.589 --> 38:22.383
Obviously, I didn't either.

38:22.967 --> 38:25.428
- Where'd he go?
- He ran off with the woman.

38:26.595 --> 38:28.514
Looks like they went towards tunnel 5.

38:29.598 --> 38:32.268
Now what? What should we do, huh?

38:33.060 --> 38:35.354
Make sure they don't escape
from the tunnels. Hurry.

38:35.980 --> 38:36.814
Yes, sir.

39:44.548 --> 39:45.591
There's no time.

39:46.300 --> 39:48.135
The Kurokos will be here soon.

39:48.219 --> 39:49.220
Seung-jo.

39:50.596 --> 39:52.014
I need you to get her out of here.

39:54.683 --> 39:58.062
In her current state, she won't get far
before they catch up to her.

39:58.938 --> 39:59.855
I'll distract them.

39:59.939 --> 40:02.858
That way, you both have enough time
to get out of this building.

40:03.984 --> 40:05.027
Please, Seung-jo.

40:07.279 --> 40:08.447
Can you do that for me?

40:12.868 --> 40:13.786
Remember tunnel 5?

40:15.079 --> 40:17.123
Turn right at the end of this hallway
and keep going.

40:17.206 --> 40:18.958
There's another tunnel at the top.

40:19.041 --> 40:20.835
It's small, so you need to look for it.

40:22.670 --> 40:23.671
I'll get her out.

40:28.467 --> 40:29.760
I'll see you outside.

40:31.053 --> 40:32.054
It will be all right.

41:20.269 --> 41:22.062
Did he not come this way?

41:24.106 --> 41:26.150
There are no other exits besides this one.

41:40.831 --> 41:42.166
Bring Seung-jo here.

42:01.852 --> 42:02.853
There you are.

42:03.979 --> 42:05.147
You found your way after all.

42:08.359 --> 42:10.069
Go out this way,
and you'll find her outside.

42:11.654 --> 42:14.490
You'll draw too much attention
with the clothes you have on.

42:16.158 --> 42:17.159
So wear these.

42:27.586 --> 42:28.629
Thanks so much, Seung-jo.

42:28.712 --> 42:31.966
All right enough already.
I've told you about patting my head.

42:33.092 --> 42:34.385
I'm not a kid anymore.

42:34.885 --> 42:38.347
I better get going.
Don't want them getting suspicious.

42:44.937 --> 42:46.355
That day, a year ago…

42:49.650 --> 42:51.318
I'm sorry I wasn't there for you.

42:52.528 --> 42:53.445
Ho-jae.

44:26.080 --> 44:31.377
♪ Candles lit in the room ♪

44:32.086 --> 44:37.466
♪ Wind from the chink swayed by it ♪

44:38.133 --> 44:41.095
♪ It's like my mind ♪

44:41.178 --> 44:43.889
♪ It's just like me ♪

44:43.972 --> 44:48.936
♪ Staring for long time ♪

44:50.062 --> 44:54.900
♪ Where the wind came from? ♪

44:56.110 --> 45:01.198
♪ Went out through the door ♪

45:02.116 --> 45:07.371
♪ Ah ♪

45:22.678 --> 45:28.434
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

45:29.101 --> 45:35.649
♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪

45:36.150 --> 45:40.529
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall ♪

45:41.071 --> 45:46.160
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

45:47.119 --> 45:52.291
♪ Hmm, mm, mm ♪

46:22.696 --> 46:28.243
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

46:29.119 --> 46:35.667
♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪

46:36.168 --> 46:40.589
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall ♪

46:41.089 --> 46:46.178
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

46:47.137 --> 46:52.309
♪ Hmm, mm, mm ♪

47:02.277 --> 47:05.072
♪ Ooh ♪

47:05.155 --> 47:08.075
♪ Ooh ♪

47:08.158 --> 47:10.994
♪ Ooh ♪

47:11.078 --> 47:13.205
♪ Ooh ♪

47:25.175 --> 47:28.762
♪ It can't be same like we used to be ♪

47:29.847 --> 47:32.891
♪ The skies are falling like the rain ♪

47:32.975 --> 47:36.144
♪ My eyes are facing towards you ♪

47:37.729 --> 47:41.692
♪ No matter it's dark, I still need you ♪

47:42.276 --> 47:45.362
♪ With you it's heaven, makes me blind ♪

47:45.445 --> 47:48.615
♪ But I'm afraid I'll lose my way ♪

